# Lab scratch. Everything here is created by the procedure in MANUAL_TESTING.md and
# demo-cdn-state.sh, which bind-mount THIS DIRECTORY into the container as /work — so a
# container-side path like `/work/altroot` lands right here, owned by root.
#
# altroot/ is the giveaway: `zpool import -R /work/altroot` needs a mountpoint, creates one,
# and leaves the empty tree behind on export. It is a mountpoint by design, not litter, and
# it kept turning up in `git status` as an untracked root-owned directory that looked like
# something had gone wrong.
altroot/

# The loop-backed pool vdev ($HERE/.vdev.img) and the fetched asset's digest.
.vdev.img
.asset.sha
